        <briefdescription>
<para>runOnSCC - This method should be implemented by the subclass to perform whatever action is necessary for the specified SCC. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Note that non-recursive (or only self-recursive) functions will have an SCC size of 1, where recursive portions of the call graph will have SCC size &gt; 1.</para>
<para>SCC passes that add or delete functions to the SCC are required to update the SCC list, otherwise stale pointers may be dereferenced. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
